<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal to release April CPI data Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Portugal to release April CPI data Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's April consumer price inflation data is expected to be released on Wednesday, but the hour of publication was not immediately known, an official of the state-run National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>A poll of eight analysts questioned by Reuters foresaw a monthly increase in prices of between 0.1 and 0.4 percent.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
